<title>USA: Sepragen shares delisted from NASDAQ.</title>
<headline>Sepragen shares delisted from NASDAQ.</headline>
<dateline>HAYWARD, California 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sepragen Corp said the NASDAQ SmallCap delisted the company's stock, effective August 15.</p>
<p>The company did not meet the market's listing standards, Sepragen said.</p>
<p>Officials from the company were not immediately available to comment further.</p>
<p>The company said that it may appeal the NASDAQ decision within 15 days.</p>
